WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.368
Vice City doesn't stop for anyone. Not even for her.

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:07.931
Lucia has eleven dollars, a stolen car,

00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:10.556
and forty minutes until sunrise.

00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:14.008
She drives like the road owes her something.

00:00:14.508 --> 00:00:16.308
Then the lights come on behind her.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.941
One cruiser. Then two.

00:00:18.941 --> 00:00:21.368
Then the intersection closes.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.456
She doesn't run.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.368
That's the part nobody expects.

00:00:28.368 --> 00:00:32.496
Door opens. Hands on the roof. Cuffs.

00:00:32.996 --> 00:00:36.836
Arrested in the first hour of her own story.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:41.584
The holding cell smells like bleach and bad decisions.

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:43.920
And then she notices it.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.756
The guard isn't watching her.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.848
He's watching the door.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.336
Nobody walks out of a police station in Vice City.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.680
Unless someone left it open.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.224
She walks.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.218
Twelve blocks.

00:01:04.218 --> 00:01:07.872
No car, no phone, no plan.

00:01:08.372 --> 00:01:11.708
Just one address she memorized before tonight.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.568
The bank on the corner is still lit.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.024
Two minutes until the shift change.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.616
Four cameras. Three guards.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.736
She doesn't count the sirens.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.056
The doors open.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.520
The blue lights arrive first.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.776
And Lucia smiles.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.168
Because this is exactly where she wanted them.

00:01:44.168 --> 00:01:46.520
The first shot isn't hers.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.400
It's the one she was waiting for.

